{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":23.329999923706055,"text":"Paint a tin plate in bright colors, a little key on the side, and a spring inside. You wind it, let go, and the toy walks, beats a drum, or turns a somersault until it runs down. It needs no batteries because the energy comes out of your hand and is stored in the spring. Most were made in the 20th century, and many are dented because they were used hard.","words":[{"word":"Paint","start":0,"end":0.5400000214576721},{"word":"a","start":0.5400000214576721,"end":0.9599999785423279},{"word":"tin","start":0.9599999785423279,"end":1.100000023841858},{"word":"plate","start":1.100000023841858,"end":1.340000033378601},{"word":"in","start":1.340000033378601,"end":1.6799999475479126},{"word":"bright","start":1.6799999475479126,"end":1.940000057220459},{"word":"colors","start":1.940000057220459,"end":2.4200000762939453},{"word":"a","start":2.7200000286102295,"end":2.880000114440918},{"word":"little","start":2.880000114440918,"end":3.119999885559082},{"word":"key","start":3.119999885559082,"end":3.299999952316284},{"word":"on","start":3.299999952316284,"end":3.5},{"word":"the","start":3.5,"end":3.680000066757202},{"word":"side","start":3.680000066757202,"end":3.9600000381469727},{"word":"and","start":4.139999866485596,"end":4.28000020980835},{"word":"a","start":4.28000020980835,"end":4.599999904632568},{"word":"spring","start":4.599999904632568,"end":4.599999904632568},{"word":"inside","start":4.599999904632568,"end":5.099999904632568},{"word":"You","start":5.659999847412109,"end":5.880000114440918},{"word":"wind","start":5.880000114440918,"end":6.019999980926514},{"word":"it","start":6.019999980926514,"end":6.28000020980835},{"word":"let","start":6.639999866485596,"end":6.78000020980835},{"word":"go","start":6.78000020980835,"end":7.039999961853027},{"word":"and","start":7.420000076293945,"end":7.519999980926514},{"word":"the","start":7.519999980926514,"end":7.800000190734863},{"word":"toy","start":